{"cwd": "/home/user/rainbow-", "entrypoint": "remote_mobile", "gitBranch": "claude/rainbow-3d-account-recovery-hfb8p0", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"content": "Web search results for query: \"three.js flowmap painter free tool flow map Water2 flowMap\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"free flow map painter for blender\",\"url\":\"https://80.lv/articles/free-flow-map-painter-for-blender\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday, October 3rd, 2012 Posted by Jim Thacker\",\"url\":\"https://www.cgchannel.com/?p=44561\"},{\"title\":\"Flow Map generator for water effect in three.js\",\"url\":\"https://discourse.threejs.org/t/flow-map-generator-for-water-effect-in-three-js/68941/8\"},{\"title\":\"Flow Map generator for water effect in three.js\",\"url\":\"https://discourse.threejs.org/t/flow-map-generator-for-water-effect-in-three-js/68941\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday, October 3rd, 2012 Posted by Jim Thacker\",\"url\":\"https://www.cgchannel.com/2012/10/paint-games-flow-maps-with-flowmap-painter\"},{\"title\":\"Flow Map Painter Adds Free Blender Painting Tools\",\"url\":\"https://digitalproduction.com/2021/04/02/flow-map-painter-tool/\"},{\"title\":\"flowmap painter\",\"url\":\"https://cgpress.org/archives/flowmap_painter.html\"},{\"title\":\"browser based flowmap painting\",\"url\":\"https://cgpress.org/archives/browser-based-flowmap-painting.html\"},{\"title\":\"free wip flowmap creation tool for unity\",\"url\":\"https://80.lv/articles/free-wip-flowmap-creation-tool-for-unity\"},{\"title\":\"A downloadable tool for Windows\",\"url\":\"https://game-dev-goose.itch.io/flow-vfx\"},{\"title\":\"clemensbeute.gumroad.com\",\"url\":\"https://clemensbeute.gumroad.com/l/heZDT\"},{\"title\":\"polycount.com\",\"url\":\"https://polycount.com/discussion/comment/1557935\"},{\"title\":\"What's the best way to create flow maps?\",\"url\":\"https://realtimevfx.com/t/whats-the-best-way-to-create-flow-maps/21962\"},{\"title\":\"# Mouse Flowmap Distortion\",\"url\":\"https://discourse.threejs.org/t/