lable for 14 days, while Digital Production says the trial includes full export capabilities. Those accounts conflict.\n\nOverall, Linux is supported according to both CGChannel and JangaFX, but the exact requirements and prices vary by source. Normal map export is unconfirmed. Checking JangaFX's current documentation or release notes would settle it.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks.", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01SenPsJQJNaMYmMCBFsmHdN", "type": "tool_result"}], "role": "user"}, "parentUuid": "1b895ff1-53a0-4264-8d73-c75734517760", "permissionDecision": {"decision": "accept", "reasonType": "rule", "ruleSource": "cliArg", "source": "config"}, "promptId": "9b0d884f-eff8-4cc6-b8f4-9c97d19413f7", "sessionId": "915f17cf-eec0-5ae4-8e79-48acc1826719", "sourceToolAssistantUUID": "1b895ff1-53a0-4264-8d73-c75734517760", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T12:54:37.797Z", "toolUseResult": {"durationSeconds": 6.406129885999952, "query": "JangaFX IlluGen pricing indie license Linux system requirements export normal map flipbook", "results": [{"content": [{"title": "Tuesday, July 29th, 2025 Posted by Jim Thacker", "url": "https://www.cgchannel.com/?p=168888"}, {"title": "Choose Your Plan", "url": "https://jangafx.com/software/pricing"}, {"title": "jangafx.com", "url": "https://jangafx.com/?p=427"}, {"title": "www.itechguides.com", "url": "https://www.itechguides.com/products/liquigen/"}, {"title": "IlluGen Real-Time Game VFX Software by JangaFX", "url": "https://gamefromscratch.com/illugen-real-time-game-vfx-software-by-jangafx/"}, {"title": "public.jangafx.com", "url": "https://public.jangafx.com/?p=427"}, {"title": "live.jangafx.com", "url": "https://live.jangafx.com/?p=427"}, {"title": "IlluGen Drops: Node-Based VFX Tool from JangaFX Now Public, and Free for 14 Days", "url": "https://digitalproduction.com/2025/07/28/illugen-drops-node-based-vfx-tool-from-jangafx-now-public-and-free-for-14-days/"}, {"title": "Monday, Jan